          <p class="eyebrow">HOW IT STARTED</p>
          <h2 id="history-title">A simple idea, brewed into <em>something special.</em></h2>
          <p class="history-lead">Brew Haven began in 2020 with a simple thought: a good cafe should feel as good as that first sip.</p>
          <p>We set out to create a place where carefully chosen coffee, fresh-from-the-kitchen bites, and genuine hospitality could come together. Since then, our doors have been open to early risers, catch-up conversations, focused afternoons, and all the little moments in between.</p>
          <p>We still believe the best things are made with care—and that there should always be room for one more at the table.</p>
          <a class="text-link" href="menu.html#coffee">Taste what we’re brewing <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
